      "urn": "urn:cts:copticLit:pschrysostom.canaanite.budge:1-51",
      "dialect": "sahidic"
    },
    {
      "coptic": "ⲡⲓⲟⲩⲁⲓ ⲅⲁⲣ ⲡⲓⲟⲩⲁⲓ ⲉϥⲉⲧⲱⲟⲩⲛ ϧⲁⲧⲉϥⲉⲧ**ⲫⲱ** ⲙⲙⲓⲛⲙⲙⲟϥ .",
      "english": "For each man will bear his own burden.",
